{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011ChK5qx19Bew5TbnY8Z838","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed the signup button overflow in `styles.css`. I did not render it in a browser, so the 375px result is from reading the CSS, not from a screenshot.\n\n**The cause:** `.cta` had a fixed `width: 420px`, which is wider than a 375px phone once the card's 16px side padding is applied. The `white-space: nowrap` rule also stopped the long label from wrapping, so it could not shrink to fit.\n\n**The changes to `.cta`:**\n- `width: 420px` became `width: 100%` with `max-width: 420px`, so the button fills the narrow card on phones and keeps its original width on desktop.\n- Added `box-sizing: border-box`, so the 24px horizontal padding and 2px border count toward the 100% width instead of pushing the button past the edge.\n- Removed `white-space: nowrap`, so the label wraps onto two lines on narrow screens.\n\nThe result at 375px should be a button about 343px wide, with the label wrapping inside it. On desktop it stays at 420px wide.\n\nI did not change `index.html`, and this directory is not a git repo, so there is no commit or diff to show."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1216,"cache_read_input_tokens":24185,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1216},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"40628ed2-8851-458a-afe2-dde867e4022a","uuid":"4706cdba-86dd-4256-9481-e6598ed43b7c","timestamp":"2026-11-23T02:38:35.388Z","request_id":"req_011ChK5qwca9mQ48rx2fGYSZ"}
